{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "ἀνήρ, ὁ , ἀνδρός, ἀνδρί, ἄνδρα, voc. ἄνερ: pl. ἄνδρες, -δρῶν, -δράσι [α^], -δρας: Aeol. dat. pl."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄνδρεσι Alc. Supp. 14.8", "author_abbreviation": "Alc.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": late nom. sg."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄνδρας Cat.Cod.Astr. 7.109.7", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": in Att. the Art. often forms a crasis with the Noun, ἁνήρ for ὁ ἀνήρ, τἀνδρός, τἀνδρί for τοῦ ἀνδρός, etc., ἅνδρες for οἱ ἄνδρες; the Ion. crasis is ὡνήρ, ὧνδρες,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 4.161", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "134", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": Ep. also ἀνέρα, ἀνέρος, ἀνέρι, dual ἀνέρε, pl. ἀνέρες, ἀνέρας, ἄνδρεσσι. [Ep. Poets mostly use α— in arsi, α^ in thesi; but in trisyll. forms with stem ἀνέρ- always α—; so also Trag. in lyr.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Tr. 1011", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "OT 869", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". But in Trag. senarians α^ always.] (ἀ- in nom. by analogy; cf. Skt. nar- from I.-"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E.", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ner-, nṛ- from nṛ-, Gk. ἀνδρ- from ṇr-):—man, opp. woman (ἄνθρωπος being man as opp. to beast),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 17.435", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 21.323", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τῶν ἀνδρῶν ἄπαις without male children,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Lg. 877e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "mostly of princes, leaders, etc., but also of free men; ἀ δήμου one of the people,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 2.198", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 17.352", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; with a qualifying word to indicate rank,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. βουληφόρος Il. 2.61", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. βασιλεύς Od. 24.253", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡγήτορες ἄ. Il. 11.687", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". man, opp. god, πατὴρ ἀνδρῶν τε θεῶν τε ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.544", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.; Διὸς ἄγγελοι ἠδὲ καὶ ἀνδρῶν ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "334", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "403", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 5.63", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: most common in pl., yet sts. in sg., e.g."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 18.432", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—freq. with a Noun added, βροτοί, θνητοὶ ἄ.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 5.197", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "10.306", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄ. ἡμίθεοι Il. 12.23", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἄ. ἥρωες ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "5.746", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—also of men, opp. monsters,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 21.303", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—of men in societies and cities,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὔτε παρ' ἀνδράσιν οὔτ' ἐν ναυσὶ κοίλαις Pi. O. 6.10", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; and so prob.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄλλοτε μέν τ' ἐπὶ Κύνθου ἐβήσαο . ., ἄλλοτε δ' ἂν νήσους τε καὶ ἀνέρας . . h.Ap. 142", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0013", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". man, opp. youth, unless the context determines the meaning, as in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὔ πως ἔστι νεωτέρῳ ἀνδρὶ μάχεσθαι ἄνδρα γέροντα Od. 18.53", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; but ἀ. alone always means a man in the prime of life, esp. warrior,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. ἕλεν ἄνδρα Il. 15.328", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; so"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. ἀντ' ἀνδρὸς ἐλύθησαν Th. 2.103", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; the several ages are given as"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "παῖς, μειράκιον, ἀ., πρεσβύτης X. Smp. 4.17", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; εἰς ἄνδρας ἐγγράφεσθαι, συντελεῖν,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 19.230", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Isoc. 12.212", "author_abbreviation": "Isoc.", "tlg_author": "0010", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ἄνδρας ἀναβῆναι BMus.Inscr. 898", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; in Inscrr. relating to contests, opp. παῖδες,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "IG 22.1138.10", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. man emphatically, man indeed,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀνέρες ἄστε, φίλοι Il. 5.529", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; freq. in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt.", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πολλοὶ μὲν ἄνθρωποι, ὀλίγοι δὲ ἄνδρες 7.210", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πρόσθεν οὐκ ἀ. ὅδ' ἦν; S. Aj. 77", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄνδρα γίγνεσθαί σε χρή E. El. 693", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. γεγένησαι δι' ἐμέ Ar. Eq. 1255", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὃ μαθὼν ἀ. ἔσει Id. Nu. 823", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄνδρας ἡγοῦνται μόνους τοὺς πλεῖστα δυναμένους καταφαγεῖν Id. Ach. 77", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰ ἄνδρες εἶεν οἱ στρατηγοί Th. 4.27", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐκέτι ἀ. ἀλλὰ σκευοφόρος X. Cyr. 4.2.25", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν Αυκομήδην . . μόνον ἄνδρα ἡγοῦντο Id. HG 7.1.24", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὐκ ἐν ἀνδράσι not like a man,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Alc. 723", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "732", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀνδρὸς τὰ προσπίπτοντα γενναίως φέρειν 'tis the part of a man . .,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Men. 771", "author_abbreviation": "Men.", "tlg_author": "0541", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. husband,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 19.291", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 24.196", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.146", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ἀνδρὸς ὥραν ἡκούσης τῆς κόρης Pl. Criti. 113d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "032", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; so"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐξοικιεῖν εἰς ἀνδρὸς [οἶκον] θυγατέρα Luc. Lex. 11", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "046", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—also of a paramour, opp. πόσις,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Tr. 551", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Hipp. 491", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Theoc. 15.131", "author_abbreviation": "Theoc.", "tlg_author": "0005", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. ἁπασῶν τῶν γυναικῶν ἐστι νῦν Pherecr. 155", "author_abbreviation": "Pherecr.", "tlg_author": "0486", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αἰγῶν ἄνερ Theoc. 8.49", "author_abbreviation": "Theoc.", "tlg_author": "0005", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". Special usages: joined with titles, professions, etc.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἰητρὸς ἀ. Il. 11.514", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀ. μάντις, ἀ. στρατηγός,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 6.83", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "92", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(dub.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. νομεύς S. OT 1118", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἄνδρες λοχῖται, λῃσταί, ἀσπιστῆρες, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "751", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "842", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Aj. 565", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; esp. in disparagement,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κλῶπες ἄ. E. Rh. 645", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. δημότης S. Ant. 690", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; with names of nations, as"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Φοίνικες ἄ. Hdt. 4.42", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. Θρῇξ E. Hec. 19", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ",al.; esp. in addresses,"}, {"kind":